{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10123050","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10123050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1012305001:0":{"text":"그럼, 이제, 의식을 시작할게요.","source_cn":"那么，现在，我要开始仪式了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD80DC69A9BD6DF55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012305002:0":{"text":"<quality_6>바람의 지배자여... 당신의 호흡과 심장 박동, 그리고 존재가 느껴집니다.</quality_6>","source_cn":"<quality_6>风的主宰啊……我立于此地，聆听你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB3C7677D1A7C22B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012305003:0":{"text":"<quality_6>먼지가 저를 대신해 저의 경건한 기도를 전할 수 있기를.</quality_6>","source_cn":"<quality_6>愿无所不在的微尘替我低语，让您知...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B094DC2B24FCF9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012305004:0":{"text":"<quality_6>저 로잔, 당신의 부름을 기다리니 저를 올바른 방향으로 인도해 주세요!</quality_6>","source_cn":"<quality_6>我名为洛桑，期待您的呼唤，请您为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5922F72DBC81ADAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012305005:0":{"text":"...! ","source_cn":"……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA75ECAFA62B2D23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1012305005":{"text":"...! ","source_cn":"……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA75ECAFA62B2D23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012305006:0":{"text":"...아무것도 들리지 않아요.","source_cn":"……我什么都没有听到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C0A43C232AB1F7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012305007:0":{"text":"그럴리가... 설마 우리의 추측이 틀린 걸까?","source_cn":"怎么会……难道我们的推断出错了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A3337D031EBF10B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1012305008:0":{"text":"아니, 이걸로 우리의 추측이 옳았다는 게 증명됐어! 이건 방랑자에 대한 시험이야.","source_cn":"不，这恰恰证明了我们的推断没有错！这确实是对风语者的考验。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB917D8EBBFCCEA42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1012305009:2":{"text":"이 세상에 숨길 수 있는 비밀이란 없어요. 아무리 단단한 벽이라도, 공기와 접촉해 아주 작은 메아리를 내는 법이죠.","source_cn":"这个世界上没有真正密不透风的墙。再坚实的岩壁，也会与空...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC623FED281EB96D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1012305010:0":{"text":"하지만 여긴 아무런 소리도 들리지 않아요. 전혀요! 즉, 이건 진짜 바위가 아니라는 거예요!","source_cn":"但这里完全没有声音，一点也没有。也就是说，这不是一块真...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A8A1CC326CD58F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1012305011:0":{"text":"...이건 마법으로 만들어 낸 장벽이고, 입구는 바위 뒤에 숨겨져 있어요!","source_cn":"——而是用魔法营造的屏障，入口就藏在岩石后！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41646FDC6B83B90D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1012305011":{"text":"...이건 마법으로 만들어 낸 장벽이고, 입구는 바위 뒤에 숨겨져 있어요!","source_cn":"——而是用魔法营造的屏障，入口就藏在岩石后！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41646FDC6B83B90D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1012305012:0":{"text":"짐작가는 게 있어요.","source_cn":"我有一个猜测。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74842F7F8E7D3AB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1012305013:0":{"text":"암벽 앞에 두 종류의 나비가 섞여 있어요. 아마도... 장벽을 허무는 방법을 암시하는 것 같아요.","source_cn":"岩壁前混杂着两种蝴蝶，这也许是在提示我们……破除屏障的方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2ED549766831852","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1012305014:0":{"text":"한 종류는 검술로 제거할 수 있고, 다른 한 종류는 라이카가 격파해야 해요.","source_cn":"一种蝴蝶，可以被剑术清除，另一种，则需要莱卡击破。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B47FB4934E44DB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1012305015:0":{"text":"만약 우리가 힘을 합쳐 나비를 공격하면 어떻게 될까?","source_cn":"如果，我们对着蝴蝶合力一击，会发生什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE79C6AB2881B3B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1012305016:0":{"text":"직접 해보는 게 낫겠어. 함께 공격하자, 라이카.","source_cn":"不如直接试试。一起上吧，莱卡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F740CCA8D662311","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"어떻게 들어가지?","source_cn":"要怎么进去呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2454974BC6BE22C9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어떻게 들어가지?","female":"어떻게 들어가지?","variant_male_record_index":"61506","variant_female_record_index":"61507","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"어때?","source_cn":"如何？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC5CC8663123B70E2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어때?","female":"어때?","variant_male_record_index":"61504","variant_female_record_index":"61505","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_f